  workspace all-feature tests PASS; strict all-target/all-feature workspace
  Clippy PASS; Maven `verify` PASS (37 scenarios, fixture checks, 66 typed
  headers and 15 typed bodies cross-decoded); `cargo fmt --all -- --check` and
  `git diff --check` PASS. Maven emitted existing JDK Unsafe/reflection
  warnings and exited 0.
- Fixture SHA-256: optional numeric/decode modes
  `2c7095818dfb39cfd892f84e585b57c4a61cf09f60f4d6dfc5489674ec340424`;
  request-header identity
  `cb0a9c871e95bdb006f7bdb5a8a54c2cf74a214ee79729a6e7470f8b62bce9c1`.
